\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  O Holy Spirit, enter in,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Among these hearts Thy work begin;
\par Thy temple deign to make Them.
\par Sun of the soul, Thou light divine,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  Around and in them brightly shine;
\par To strength and gladness wake them.
\par Where Thou shinest, there is given
\par Light from heaven we before Thee,
\par For that precious gift implore Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  O mighty Rock! O source of life!
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Let Thy dear word, mid doubt and  strife,
\par Be so within them burning
\par That they be faithful unto death;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj In Thy pure love and Holy faith,
\par From Thee true wisdom learning.
\par Lord, Thy graces on them shower,
\par by thy power Christ confessing,
\par Let them win this grace and blessing.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3   O gentle dew, from heav'n now fall
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj   With pow'r upon the heart of all,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Thy tenderness instilling.
\par That heart to heart more closely bound
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj May rich in kindly deeds be found,
\par The law of love fulfilling.
\par  No wrath, no strife here shall grieve thee.
\par  They receive Thee where Thou livest;
\par  Peace and love, and joy Thou givest.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Grant that our days, while life shall last,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj  In purest holiness be pass'd;
\par  Our minds so rule and strengthen
\par  That they may rise o'er things of earth,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj O'er hopes and joys that here have birth,
\par Until Thou, Lord, dost end them.
\par Keep thou pure, Lord, from offences
\par Heart and senses; blessed Spirit,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Grant us life to thus inherit.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

